# Claude Code Global Instructions

## gstack

All web browsing must use the `/browse` skill from gstack. **Never use `mcp__claude-in-chrome__*` tools directly.**

### Available gstack skills

- `/office-hours` — async Q&A and lightweight consultations
- `/plan-ceo-review` — CEO-level plan review
- `/plan-eng-review` — Engineering plan review
- `/plan-design-review` — Design plan review
- `/design-consultation` — Design consultation
- `/review` — General code/work review
- `/ship` — Ship a feature end-to-end
- `/browse` — **Web browsing (use this instead of mcp__claude-in-chrome__\* tools)**
- `/qa` — Full QA pass
- `/qa-only` — QA without implementation
- `/design-review` — Design review
- `/setup-browser-cookies` — Set up browser cookies for authenticated browsing
- `/retro` — Retrospective
- `/investigate` — Investigation / root cause analysis
- `/document-release` — Document a release
- `/codex` — Codex-assisted tasks
- `/careful` — Extra-careful mode for high-risk changes
- `/freeze` — Freeze a codebase / prevent changes
- `/guard` — Guard mode to protect against unwanted edits
- `/unfreeze` — Unfreeze a codebase
- `/gstack-upgrade` — Upgrade gstack to the latest version
